Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 18:43:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 852/913] dts: stm32: select the LSI clock for the flexclkgen
 resource 41 (LPTIM4)

LPTIM4 is used by Cortex-M0 in Standby1. In Standby1, autonomous
clock mode is used and a local clock source (LSI or LSE) must be
selected. To keep LPTIM4 D3 peripheral clocked, select LSI as the
source clock for flexclkgen 41. No divider is applied.

